# Boot to a new game: tools/boot_test.py plays this with --input.
# <vblank> <buttons> [vblanks held, default 6]
100 CROSS 4     # the notice that there is nowhere to save (--saves none)
300 START 4     # skip the logos
400 START 4     # Press Start
500 CROSS 4     # New Game (the cursor starts on it)
740 START 4     # skip the opening movie (from its eleventh picture on, as on the PS2)
# the opening's messages
700 CROSS 4
800 CROSS 4
900 CROSS 4
1000 CROSS 4
1100 CROSS 4
1200 CROSS 4
1300 CROSS 4
1400 CROSS 4
